{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1200061,\"title\":\"The Haunting of Harrington House\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"A young woman who lives in a supposedly haunted house finds that her camera is picking up images of ghosts, and soon strange spirits begin to appear to her.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/c5qF2VLTW2ntdflRPYlLrASCvjS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":1981,\"runtime\":45,\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Mystery\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Murray Golden\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1214935,\"name\":\"Murray Golden\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":10084,\"name\":\"Dominique Dunne\",\"character\":\"Polly Ames\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fGPpYzg6lp6pIV439C5Luskk7VX.jpg\"},{\"id\":24368,\"name\":\"Roscoe Lee Browne\",\"character\":\"Diogenes 'D.C.' Chase\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zNOJbPMeQd5thNTA1dvb1ZT61mI.jpg\"},{\"id\":4098,\"name\":\"Edie Adams\",\"character\":\"Madame Zenia\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wA8UQVoIG2OFZe6goZWmNGPuaBR.jpg\"},{\"id\":3433,\"name\":\"Phil Leeds\",\"character\":\"Uncle Max\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5eUEN9aSxmEa8IGpcsieArYTOVV.jpg\"},{\"id\":82779,\"name\":\"Vito Scotti\",\"character\":\"Marco Roselli\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zDGtXkASxpo3DzMNz6OI3NOp9v0.jpg\"},{\"id\":47759,\"name\":\"James T. Callahan\",\"character\":\"Walter Ames\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tmVnvC6bjxX5PBj1OniCjuahLrc.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1084242,\"title\":\"Zootopia 2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oJ7g2CifqpStmoYQyaLQgEU32qO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lgotja3xMoJZbynwHfcQcJAEMWH.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After cracking the biggest case in Zootopia's history, rookie cops Judy Hopps and Nick Wilde find themselves on the twisting trail of a great mystery when Gary De'Snake arrives and turns the animal metropolis upside down. To crack the case, Judy and Nick must go undercover to unexpected new parts of town, where their growing partnership is tested like never before.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1301421,\"title\":\"The Sheep Detectives\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iKy5460GdsoknM8ppmGlJbKxAKa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g6uEVedSBXsZ3QuXKP4WDCeSsOy.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"George Hardy is a shepherd who reads detective novels to his beloved sheep every night, assuming they can't possibly understand. But when a mysterious incident disrupts life on the farm, the sheep realize they must become the detectives. As they follow the clues and investigate human suspects, they prove that even sheep can be brilliant crime-solvers.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":158852,\"title\":\"Tomorrowland\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kziYpr5Nfw60P0My8aj1sgCEqed.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/udYOmbW1JEZjVd726PWHlmptxPi.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Bound by a shared destiny, a bright, optimistic teen bursting with scientific curiosity and a former boy-genius inventor jaded by disillusionment embark on a danger-filled mission to unearth the secrets of an enigmatic place somewhere in time and space that exists in their collective memory as \\\"Tomorrowland.\\\"\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Family\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10982,\"title\":\"Hoodwinked!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kwPl1AKX4BLxrh5PCkrwYWeEV5I.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/97i5zrV5Kmhi3NYJ7PzcfHmMNx8.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Little Red Riding Hood: A classic story, but there's more to every tale than meets the eye. Before you judge a book by its cover, you've got to flip through the pages. In the re-telling of this classic fable, the story begins at the end of the tale and winds its way back. Chief Grizzly and Detective Bill Stork investigate a domestic disturbance at Granny's cottage, involving a karate-kicking Red Riding Hood, a sarcastic wolf and an oafish Woodsman.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":12096,\"title\":\"The Pink Panther\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/57ViRkdsddHLK32W8Nf3ZPLSAu4.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3jiNJ4lyAmdSidvbFTFIL2GQGBu.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When the coach of the France football team is killed by a poisoned dart in the stadium at the end of a game, and his huge, expensive ring with the Pink Panther diamond  disappears, the ambitious Chief Inspector Dreyfus assigns the worst police inspector – Jacques Clouseau – to the case.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Mystery\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":385103,\"title\":\"Scoob!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jHo2M1OiH9Re33jYtUQdfzPeUkx.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sJjuXNHNT7PfzcgkqM3oSIkVOXB.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In Scooby-Doo’s greatest adventure yet, see the never-before told story of how lifelong friends Scooby and Shaggy first met and how they joined forces with young detectives Fred, Velma, and Daphne to form the famous Mystery Inc. Now, with hundreds of cases solved, Scooby and the gang face their biggest, toughest mystery ever: an evil plot to unleash the ghost dog Cerberus upon the world. As they race to stop this global “dogpocalypse,” the gang discovers that Scooby has a secret legacy and an epic destiny greater than anyone ever imagined.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":420821,\"title\":\"Chip 'n Dale: Rescue Rangers\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7UGmn8TyWPPzkjhLUW58cOUHjPS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qK7Ssnrfvrt65F66A1thvehfQg2.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Decades since their successful television series was canceled, Chip has succumbed to a life of suburban domesticity as an insurance salesman. Dale, meanwhile, has had CGI surgery and works the nostalgia convention circuit, desperate to relive his glory days. When a former cast mate mysteriously disappears, Chip and Dale must repair their broken friendship and take on their Rescue Rangers detective personas once again to save their friend’s life.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10756,\"title\":\"The Haunted Mansion\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lGi5yio4pdDz5PkSeZCbnMQz5vK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uUgn9P3Ulmjt9bOfp5Yt83fauAS.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Workaholic Jim Evers and his wife/business partner Sara get a call one night from  a mansion owner, Edward Gracey, who wants to sell his house. Once the Evers family arrive at the mansion, a torrential thunderstorm of mysterious origin strands them with the brooding, eccentric Gracey, his mysterious butler, and a variety of residents both seen and unseen.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Fantasy\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":463821,\"title\":\"The House with a Clock in Its Walls\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qM66Hv4ByAxnilr0jaqCA9uOD4Y.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tQvvRReWhrXnj28s4AIp2PblByg.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When ten-year-old Lewis is suddenly orphaned, he is sent to live with his Uncle Jonathan in a creaky (and creepy) old mansion with a mysterious ticking noise that emanates from the walls. Upon discovering that his uncle is a warlock, Lewis begins learning magic, but when he rebelliously resurrects an evil warlock he must find the secret of the house and save the world from destruction.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":383785,\"title\":\"Kung Fu Yoga\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rL6XM4fsr1cM5mN2flEhQ8jQter.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/meS8C4fE5RbhZBf754WdQ8MiT9f.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Two professors team up to locate a lost treasure and embark on an adventure that takes them from a Tibetan ice cave to Dubai, and to a mountain temple in India.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Mystery\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":370567,\"title\":\"Sherlock Gnomes\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wqnzpJR3PwS4doVkAkt9seSEpoX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jVUR1W6cq8VuT4A6N4fd2yDNhji.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Garden gnomes Gnomeo & Juliet recruit renown detective Sherlock Gnomes to investigate the mysterious disappearance of other garden ornaments.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1015724,\"title\":\"Trick or Treat Scooby-Doo!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wZccw4Hj9ZF1yimnfPsX9rl3HvB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zoL7dO6Uw8wOtkhfrwryevQudSK.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Mystery Inc. has cracked the case to top all cases! They’ve tracked down Coco Diablo, the head of a notorious costume crime syndicate. With Coco and her kitty in prison, Mystery Inc. thinks that they can finally enjoy a break. Wrong! Suddenly, menacing doppelgänger ghosts of the Scooby crew and favorite classic foes show up in Coolsville to threaten Halloween. Now it’s up to the meddling kids to unmask the latest scoundrel and save Halloween!\",\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Animation\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"CsLhgnUISKo\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"htVrDcB2H-E\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"ymrRPb-go5A\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}